       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Social/emotional:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " is shy, clingy, or fearful around strangers; shows several facial expressions, like happy, sad, angry, and surprised; looks when you call his name; reacts when you leave (looks, reaches for you, or cries); smiles or laughs when you play peek-a-boo."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
